  "hypothesis": "H71-A: Multi-Modal Hydrothermal-Structural Conduit & Alteration-Demagnetization Convergence. Blind and unmapped Great Basin geothermal fault conduits are jointly expressed by the spatial convergence of (1) GDR 1391 2 m temperature probe conductive anomalies, paleo-geothermal sinter/travertine deposits, and thermal spring/geothermometer upflow plumes, (2) shallow fault-zone magnetite destruction (Jacobsen upward-continuation differential RTP - TMI_up150 trough), GeoDAWN K/Th potassium-metasomatism gradients, and clay-cap electrical conductivity edges, (3) Gallardo-Meju (2003) collinear cross-gradient basement detachment steps and geodetic-seismic transtensional shear/dilatation, and (4) 1-3 m LiDAR scarplet curvature dipoles and 10 m topographic ridges.",
  "physical_mechanism": "Upwelling hydrothermal fluids (>=80 C quartz/chalcedony geothermometer reservoirs) migrate along critically stressed transtensional fault step-overs, relay ramps, and range-front detachments. Fluid-rock interaction oxidizes primary titanomagnetite to non-magnetic pyrite/hematite in the upper 150-300 m breccia zone (creating a localized short-wavelength magnetic trough between RTP and 150 m upward-continued TMI), enriches potassium relative to immobile thorium (adularia/illite alteration), precipitates smectite/illite clay caps (sharp lateral conductivity gradients) and surface sinter/travertine, and generates subtle 0.2-1.5 m surface scarplets in 1-3 m LiDAR and 10 m DEM curvature.",
  "named_non_fault_mimic_process_and_mitigation": "Stratiform altered rhyolitic ash-flow tuffs, closed evaporitic playa lakes (alkali flats with high surface electrical conductivity and K-feldspar detritus), and anthropogenic road/mining earthworks can mimic individual radiometric, conductivity, or micro-topographic signals. H71-A suppresses these non-fault mimics by requiring multi-modal structural concordance (collinear gravity-basement cross-gradient step + anisotropic scarplet dipole/facing net of cross-slope channel banks + transtensional strain) and applying an explicit cultural-artifact suppression mask within 75 m of TIGER roads and 60 m of BLM mining claims.",
